s of a Data Protection Officer, not the competence or territorial jurisdiction of the supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.55, "holistic_label": "uncovered", "id": "f22083862873c07d9d92", "condition": "negative_control", "required": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-649", "jurisdiction": "UAE", "n_candidates": 2}
